https://dados.fortaleza.ce.gov.br/catalogo/organization/about/etufor

URLs:
  http://gistapis.etufor.ce.gov.br:8081/api/linhas/

  http://gistapis.etufor.ce.gov.br:8081/api/itinerario/ + idLinha  

  http://gistapis.etufor.ce.gov.br:8081/api/logradouros/

  http://gistapis.etufor.ce.gov.br:8081/api/horarios/ + idLinha + ?data= + data // data: YYYYMMDD  

  http://gistapis.etufor.ce.gov.br:8081/api/LinhasDologradouro/ + idLogradouro

  pontos de controle: https://dados.fortaleza.ce.gov.br/dataset/b959a013-d884-497d-9554-197503029086/resource/81cf6cb7-0fdc-4c64-9063-a27dab1be50d/download/pontos.xml


AsyncStogarge:
  https://react-native-async-storage.github.io/async-storage/docs/usage
  Async Storage can only store string data, so in order to store object data you need to serialize 
  it first. For data that can be serialized to JSON you can use JSON.stringify() when saving the 
  data and JSON.parse() when loading the data.
